{"id": "agentNode_PX2fEjRb8n6q", "type": "agentNode", "position": {"x": 304, "y": 1376},
 "data": {"label": "", "description": "The worker: own model, own tools, Interact with DB off, memory in the dictionary", "labelNode": "LLM", "descriptionNode": "Use LLM processor", "open": false, "openLLM": false, "openPrompt": false,
  "settings": {
   "agentId": "warranty-advisor", "agentName": "Warranty Advisor", "sessionId": "", "requestId": "",
   "llm": {"company": "openai", "model": "gpt-5.4-mini", "modelId": 4935, "parameters": {"maxTokens": 4000, "reasoningEffort": "low"}},
   "prompts": [
    {"id": "p0", "role": "system", "content": "You are the warranty desk of Brightway Bikes (fictional). You work for the support agent, not for the customer.\n\nThe policy: frames 5 years, motor and battery 2 years from the purchase date; a battery under 60 % health within those 2 years is replaced free; wear parts (tyres, brake pads, chain) are not covered; a claim needs the order number.\n\nYour task: ${dictionary.warranty.task}\n\nYour notes so far (what your tools found):\n${dictionary.warranty.notes}\n\nWhen you need a tool, write exactly one block, with each marker at the start of a line:\n\n<SYSTEM CALL>\n!*action\nuse tool\n!*tool\n<the tool's name>\n!*context\n<the input the tool needs>\n</SYSTEM CALL>\n\nWrite nothing else inside the block, then wait: the tool's reply arrives as the next user message. Only the first block of an answer runs.\n\nTools:\n1. Order Lookup\nDescription: what an order contains, when it was bought and how many months ago.\nUsage: !*context is JSON {\"orderNumber\": \"BW-50017\"}.\n\nUse at most 4 tool calls. Then answer in at most 80 words: covered or not, why, and what the customer must do. No greeting."}
   ],
   "specialRules": [{"type": "skip-internal-database-interactions"}]
  }},
 "dragHandle": ".drag-handle__custom"},
{"id": "scriptNode_FsPwPwH5uj7c", "type": "scriptNode", "position": {"x": 304, "y": 1808},
